  "title": "DBS Phantom Recordings",
  "description": "MEG recordings of a CTF phantom acquired in the presence of deep brain stimulation (DBS) artefacts. The dataset supports evaluation of artefact rejection methods for MEG data contaminated by DBS. It is a subset of the data used in a study comparing the performance of DBS artefact rejection approaches.",
  "methods_description": "Phantom measurements were performed with a CTF MEG system. The stimulation reference signal was captured on channel EEG001, the movement trigger on UPPT001, and the dipole activity on HADC006. Customized Matlab code for the artefact rejection methods is available in a public GitLab repository.",
